From c397c768de6e213305a89c260049e0dbb88b966a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DrakeRamorayJr <179530612+DrakeRamorayJr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:31:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make the address bar the tab sheet's top, and search tabs
 from the row.

In Sheet mode the address bar now shrinks into a 32dp origin pill that rides
the sheet's top edge as it rises, in one motion driven by the sheet's
progress, and grows back into the bar as it closes. The bar cross-fades out
as the pill fades in, so the two never show at once. A pull from the bar
keeps the bar alive to touch until the finger lifts, so the sheet always
settles. Tapping the pill closes the sheet and focuses the omnibox. Sideways
tab swipes on the bar are off while the sheet is open.

The overlay Search tabs field is gone. A magnifier at the end of the "N tabs"
row grows, in place, into a rounded search field across that row; the sheet
goes full and the list filters live. Back hides the keyboard, then clears
the search, then closes the sheet; with no keyboard up, the first Back
clears. Back also works while the field has made the glass window focusable.

With a top address bar the pill shrinks in place in the bar's row and the
sheet drops below it. The side drawer is unchanged.

Tested on the Android emulator (Pixel 10 Pro profile).
